(5719690, 831809, 37252, '<td valign="top">Nice vantage point. I''m guessing you came out a door of a different building though as it looks like if you walked 35 steps, then turned to walk 6, then turned and walked the final six you would either be in the water or only half say across the bridge. Don''t worry - I wouldn''t strike you down on such a nice image.</td>', 'Nice vantage point. I''m guessing you came out a door of a different building though as it looks like if you walked 35 steps, then turned to walk 6, then turned and walked the final six you would either be in the water or only half say across the bridge. Don''t worry - I wouldn''t strike you down on such a nice image.', '2009-11-09 02:45:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(5719691, 831546, 37252, '<td valign="top">wow - you must be walking on clouds with the roof tops in the foreground just below your height.</td>', 'wow - you must be walking on clouds with the roof tops in the foreground just below your height.', '2009-11-09 02:46:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(5719693, 832383, 45475, '<td valign="top">I''m not buying it. Do you live on a rock sir? Besides, this is a shocker. It''s over-sharpened, too much neat image and HDR isn''t even real photography. Did you photoshop the clouds too? Bleh, back in my day....<br/> <br/>p.s. you forgot the dust bunnies in the top right corner.</td>', 'I''m not buying it. Do you live on a rock sir? Besides, this is a shocker. It''s over-sharpened, too much neat image and HDR isn''t even real photography. Did you photoshop the clouds too? Bleh, back in my day.... p.s. you forgot the dust bunnies in the top right corner.', '2009-11-09 02:48:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(5719694, 832387, 37252, '<td valign="top">I''m guessing there was n o way you could get yourself placed for a better vantage point by following the rules. I had the same problem with my entry.</td>', 'I''m guessing there was n o way you could get yourself placed for a better vantage point by following the rules. I had the same problem with my entry.', '2009-11-09 02:48:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(5719695, 832048, 37252, '<td valign="top">Hope you had your waders on. j/k  <br/> <br/>I just can''t find a focal spot...one specific image at all that is in sharp focus. So, my eye gets pulled all over the place. I think the soft focus throughout may hurt you.</td>', 'Hope you had your waders on. j/k   I just can''t find a focal spot...one specific image at all that is in sharp focus. So, my eye gets pulled all over the place. I think the soft focus throughout may hurt you.', '2009-11-09 02:50:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(5719696, 832604, 37252, '<td valign="top">Very good - your sharp focus really brings out the details. Good bokeh too.</td>', 'Very good - your sharp focus really brings out the details. Good bokeh too.', '2009-11-09 02:51:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(5719701, 832466, 37252, '<td valign="top">Very nice. I wonder how long you had to stand there waiting for birds to fly by. lol  I like the composition, colors, and formation of the birds.</td>', 'Very nice. I wonder how long you had to stand there waiting for birds to fly by. lol  I like the composition, colors, and formation of the birds.', '2009-11-09 02:53:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(5719702, 832482, 37252, '<td valign="top">Living out in the middle of nowhere - my style of living too!  I can''t say I care much for the pp though. The colors look muted, dull.</td>', 'Living out in the middle of nowhere - my style of living too!  I can''t say I care much for the pp though. The colors look muted, dull.', '2009-11-09 02:56:53.000000', NULL, 1),
