(5719708, 831607, 37252, '<td valign="top">while there isn''t really interesting going on here, you can''t really help it with a challenge like this. For the hand we were dealt, I think you did good. Nice focus on the mailbox post and address tag. The bokeh is good too.</td>', 'while there isn''t really interesting going on here, you can''t really help it with a challenge like this. For the hand we were dealt, I think you did good. Nice focus on the mailbox post and address tag. The bokeh is good too.', '2009-11-09 03:02:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(5719710, 832277, 37252, '<td valign="top">You are a brave soul to get close to a bee, so you deserve one extra point just for that. lol Pretty flowers. Your composition is well executed. I like the way my eye is first on the flowers but then follows those flowers right down to the bee. Good work.</td>', 'You are a brave soul to get close to a bee, so you deserve one extra point just for that. lol Pretty flowers. Your composition is well executed. I like the way my eye is first on the flowers but then follows those flowers right down to the bee. Good work.', '2009-11-09 03:04:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(5719711, 831528, 37252, '<td valign="top">Pretty flowers, could have been sharper in focus to bring out the details better.</td>', 'Pretty flowers, could have been sharper in focus to bring out the details better.', '2009-11-09 03:05:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(5719713, 832618, 37252, '<td valign="top">I can just hear the rustle of those leafs right now - as I watch snow falling in my yard. :\  Nice colors</td>', 'I can just hear the rustle of those leafs right now - as I watch snow falling in my yard. :\  Nice colors', '2009-11-09 03:06:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(5719717, 832557, 37252, '<td valign="top">Nice shot - perhaps a bit more contrast would be my only suggestion.</td>', 'Nice shot - perhaps a bit more contrast would be my only suggestion.', '2009-11-09 03:12:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(5719719, 832374, 37252, '<td valign="top">Pretty colors, and like the shallow DOF. I wonder how this image would be with the focus on the bee instead of the stamen? Either way you did a good job.</td>', 'Pretty colors, and like the shallow DOF. I wonder how this image would be with the focus on the bee instead of the stamen? Either way you did a good job.', '2009-11-09 03:14:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(5719720, 832599, 37252, '<td valign="top">Too dark for me and using a red tint doesn''t help. jmho</td>', 'Too dark for me and using a red tint doesn''t help. jmho', '2009-11-09 03:15:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(5719724, 831711, 37252, '<td valign="top">Interesting foliage you have 47 steps out your door. All in all, I find this to be too busy. Perhaps a shallower DOF keeping the background blurred then my eye could pick out a specific point of interest.</td>', 'Interesting foliage you have 47 steps out your door. All in all, I find this to be too busy. Perhaps a shallower DOF keeping the background blurred then my eye could pick out a specific point of interest.', '2009-11-09 03:18:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(5719725, 832049, 37252, '<td valign="top">Looks over processed - too much sharpening. But that is just my opinion.<br/>This is your creation and if you are pleased with it as is, then you can be proud of it.</td>', 'Looks over processed - too much sharpening. But that is just my opinion.This is your creation and if you are pleased with it as is, then you can be proud of it.', '2009-11-09 03:20:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(5719727, 831820, 37252, '<td valign="top">Amazing how so many people here are brave enough to get so close to bees!</td>', 'Amazing how so many people here are brave enough to get so close to bees!', '2009-11-09 03:22:39.000000', NULL, 1),
