(5719733, 832592, 37252, '<td valign="top">Every 1/2 hour - even at night? As much as I like trains I don''t think I would want one that close to my back door every half hour.</td>', 'Every 1/2 hour - even at night? As much as I like trains I don''t think I would want one that close to my back door every half hour.', '2009-11-09 03:30:06.000000', NULL, 1),
