(5725288, 832597, 18197, '<td valign="top">I lived in San Ramon off and on for about 10 years in the late 80''s and early 90''s. Nice place. Nice weather. This is an interesting take on it. The houses along the left, at first glance, look like cliffs or rims of a valley ... then I look closer and they''re houses. I like that inthe photo. And at first, you don''t see the freeway next to the gravel road, and then you do. And at first you don''t notice the curb, and then you do. Overall it''s a bit sureel. Well done.</td>', 'I lived in San Ramon off and on for about 10 years in the late 80''s and early 90''s. Nice place. Nice weather. This is an interesting take on it. The houses along the left, at first glance, look like cliffs or rims of a valley ... then I look closer and they''re houses. I like that inthe photo. And at first, you don''t see the freeway next to the gravel road, and then you do. And at first you don''t notice the curb, and then you do. Overall it''s a bit sureel. Well done.', '2009-11-13 09:21:42.000000', NULL, 1),
