(5726064, 832618, 111808, '<td valign="top">Earthtones with a touch of red, gold &amp; green - this is so well defined that you can almost hear the crackle of the dried up leaves underfoot.  Each is unique and beautiful seperately yet each blends together to make a balanced cohesive whole of darks &amp; lights, shapes &amp; textures. The gathering of Autumn is very well done against the patch of smooth definition on the lower left.</td>', 'Earthtones with a touch of red, gold & green - this is so well defined that you can almost hear the crackle of the dried up leaves underfoot.  Each is unique and beautiful seperately yet each blends together to make a balanced cohesive whole of darks & lights, shapes & textures. The gathering of Autumn is very well done against the patch of smooth definition on the lower left.', '2009-11-14 00:23:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(5726067, 831671, 111808, '<td valign="top">A cute, young, thin-tailed critter who seems to be eyeing the photographer with an extremely aware knowledge. Fall is here - can you spare a nut please? Great emotive crisp portrait set off well by the blurred background.</td>', 'A cute, young, thin-tailed critter who seems to be eyeing the photographer with an extremely aware knowledge. Fall is here - can you spare a nut please? Great emotive crisp portrait set off well by the blurred background.', '2009-11-14 00:26:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(5726068, 832557, 80859, '<td valign="top">stunning</td>', 'stunning', '2009-11-14 00:28:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(5726070, 831841, 111808, '<td valign="top">The death of one single red Autumn leaf casually held by a small pond is a memorable study of diverse textures &amp; myriad colours. The subtle rainbows of the rocks blend well with the darker eddies of the quiescent water furnishing last life to the leaf slowly crumbling into pieces. This is beautiful.</td>', 'The death of one single red Autumn leaf casually held by a small pond is a memorable study of diverse textures & myriad colours. The subtle rainbows of the rocks blend well with the darker eddies of the quiescent water furnishing last life to the leaf slowly crumbling into pieces. This is beautiful.', '2009-11-14 00:31:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(5726074, 832423, 111808, '<td valign="top">Magnificent texture in the macro acorn, even the one small nick on the left. It has given me a new perspective on common things.</td>', 'Magnificent texture in the macro acorn, even the one small nick on the left. It has given me a new perspective on common things.', '2009-11-14 00:34:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(5726077, 832563, 111808, '<td valign="top">This is a superb photograph. I love the juxaposition of colours, tones, textures, crisp raindrops,symmetry &amp; balance. It is still &amp; invites study &amp; review &amp; it is at the same time diagonally dynamic. Kudos all around on this beautiful Autumn sonata, one of my definite favourites.</td>', 'This is a superb photograph. I love the juxaposition of colours, tones, textures, crisp raindrops,symmetry & balance. It is still & invites study & review & it is at the same time diagonally dynamic. Kudos all around on this beautiful Autumn sonata, one of my definite favourites.', '2009-11-14 00:41:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(5726079, 832595, 111808, '<td valign="top">I like the curvature &amp; repeating elements of the very red mailboxes juxtaposed against the black floor in which they are reflected broken up by the lower left centre lines in yet another direction. Between contrasting colours &amp; lines, this is a real eyecatcher &amp; a joy to view.</td>', 'I like the curvature & repeating elements of the very red mailboxes juxtaposed against the black floor in which they are reflected broken up by the lower left centre lines in yet another direction. Between contrasting colours & lines, this is a real eyecatcher & a joy to view.', '2009-11-14 00:44:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(5726118, 832393, 104841, '<td valign="top">nice composition, may have wanted a touch more depth of field to get that whole front leaf.</td>', 'nice composition, may have wanted a touch more depth of field to get that whole front leaf.', '2009-11-14 02:57:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(5726120, 832279, 104841, '<td valign="top">a nice creative shot. I would have cropped out that white line at the bottom, then again I guess you wanted long legs. If would have helped the shot if the shadow of the fence was in line with that joint in the pavement.</td>', 'a nice creative shot. I would have cropped out that white line at the bottom, then again I guess you wanted long legs. If would have helped the shot if the shadow of the fence was in line with that joint in the pavement.', '2009-11-14 03:02:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(5726122, 831880, 104841, '<td valign="top">nice interesting angle. If only the pole number was 4744 instead of 4844!</td>', 'nice interesting angle. If only the pole number was 4744 instead of 4844!', '2009-11-14 03:03:40.000000', NULL, 1),
