(5726850, 831703, 47852, '<td valign="top">Love the layers that create the feeling of depth, as well as the natural tones here.  That inner border that chops off the pups legs is nagging at me though.  Not sure why you chose to put it in further on the bottom edge.  Still, a nicely done, and unique shot.</td>', 'Love the layers that create the feeling of depth, as well as the natural tones here.  That inner border that chops off the pups legs is nagging at me though.  Not sure why you chose to put it in further on the bottom edge.  Still, a nicely done, and unique shot.', '2009-11-14 19:19:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(5726854, 832553, 47852, '<td valign="top">I don''t know what it is about this shot, but I love it.  It''s probably a combination of the lighting and the unique perspective.  Or maybe it''s the fact that it feels like you''re tucked away in a safe, quiet spot.  Either way, I like it.  That''s enough for me :)</td>', 'I don''t know what it is about this shot, but I love it.  It''s probably a combination of the lighting and the unique perspective.  Or maybe it''s the fact that it feels like you''re tucked away in a safe, quiet spot.  Either way, I like it.  That''s enough for me :)', '2009-11-14 19:24:00.000000', NULL, 1),
