(5727241, 832538, 99263, '<td valign="top">I like your style and I recognize it instantly now. Very nice. Actually browsed through your portfolio a while ago.</td>', 'I like your style and I recognize it instantly now. Very nice. Actually browsed through your portfolio a while ago.', '2009-11-15 08:03:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(5727247, 831889, 15711, '<td valign="top">I love the painterly qualities!  So pretty.</td>', 'I love the painterly qualities!  So pretty.', '2009-11-15 08:16:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(5727248, 832625, 15711, '<td valign="top">Fun light and movement.  Wish that hydrant wasn''t in the foreground.</td>', 'Fun light and movement.  Wish that hydrant wasn''t in the foreground.', '2009-11-15 08:17:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(5727249, 832562, 15711, '<td valign="top">I love the mystery of it.  It has a graphic quality as well.</td>', 'I love the mystery of it.  It has a graphic quality as well.', '2009-11-15 08:18:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(5727250, 832482, 15711, '<td valign="top">I think John Wayne may appear on a horse at the horizon any minute! :~)</td>', 'I think John Wayne may appear on a horse at the horizon any minute! :~)', '2009-11-15 08:19:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(5727251, 832356, 15711, '<td valign="top">That sky is killer!!!</td>', 'That sky is killer!!!', '2009-11-15 08:19:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(5727253, 831607, 15711, '<td valign="top">I like the image but that "bee" border is a bit distracting for me. :~)</td>', 'I like the image but that "bee" border is a bit distracting for me. :~)', '2009-11-15 08:20:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(5727254, 832592, 15711, '<td valign="top">Love this.  The sky, the tilt, the complimentary  yellows and blues!!</td>', 'Love this.  The sky, the tilt, the complimentary  yellows and blues!!', '2009-11-15 08:21:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(5727257, 831671, 15711, '<td valign="top">Darling. I''m smiling, thanks to this.</td>', 'Darling. I''m smiling, thanks to this.', '2009-11-15 08:21:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(5727258, 832475, 15711, '<td valign="top">There''s just something about those classic shoes!!  I like it.</td>', 'There''s just something about those classic shoes!!  I like it.', '2009-11-15 08:21:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(5727259, 832538, 15711, '<td valign="top">Everyone is in suspended animation.  A moment in time.</td>', 'Everyone is in suspended animation.  A moment in time.', '2009-11-15 08:22:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(5727260, 831427, 15711, '<td valign="top">I love the subtlety of the light.  This is a classic for me.</td>', 'I love the subtlety of the light.  This is a classic for me.', '2009-11-15 08:22:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(5727261, 831703, 15711, '<td valign="top">Maybe a touch tight on the bottom crop but FANTASTIC.  I''d not have included that brown border though.  Simple white or black is best IMHO. :~)</td>', 'Maybe a touch tight on the bottom crop but FANTASTIC.  I''d not have included that brown border though.  Simple white or black is best IMHO. :~)', '2009-11-15 08:23:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(5727262, 831689, 15711, '<td valign="top">I like this a lot.  The blur (lensbaby?) is great.</td>', 'I like this a lot.  The blur (lensbaby?) is great.', '2009-11-15 08:24:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(5727263, 832028, 15711, '<td valign="top">YAY, Infiniti!!! Looks like a little Pacman symbol. LOL I like it.</td>', 'YAY, Infiniti!!! Looks like a little Pacman symbol. LOL I like it.', '2009-11-15 08:25:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(5727265, 832381, 15711, '<td valign="top">I immediately thought of the classic Hitchcock film "Rear Window."</td>', 'I immediately thought of the classic Hitchcock film "Rear Window."', '2009-11-15 08:26:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(5727266, 832597, 15711, '<td valign="top">Really stunning colors.</td>', 'Really stunning colors.', '2009-11-15 08:26:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(5727267, 832371, 15711, '<td valign="top">LOVE the colors.</td>', 'LOVE the colors.', '2009-11-15 08:26:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(5727286, 832536, 110876, '<td valign="top">Nice framing.  I initally liked it.  My eye was drawn to the bottom right because of the focus.  As I followed the stem up the focus (and my interest) was lost.  <br/>If the whole forground were in focus (keeping the backbround as blurry as possible) it would have been worth a few more points.</td>', 'Nice framing.  I initally liked it.  My eye was drawn to the bottom right because of the focus.  As I followed the stem up the focus (and my interest) was lost.  If the whole forground were in focus (keeping the backbround as blurry as possible) it would have been worth a few more points.', '2009-11-15 08:51:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(5727288, 832619, 110876, '<td valign="top">I like the composition and key.  The subject could be in better focus.</td>', 'I like the composition and key.  The subject could be in better focus.', '2009-11-15 08:55:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(5727387, 831237, 108580, '<td valign="top">Ow, American Suburbia... Very well composed, lit, and titled. Can''t vote but damn nice shot. Even the odd star peeping through.</td>', 'Ow, American Suburbia... Very well composed, lit, and titled. Can''t vote but damn nice shot. Even the odd star peeping through.', '2009-11-15 12:04:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(5727390, 832627, 108580, '<td valign="top">Very clever... not sure how the PP SC council take this but I''m on your side.<br/>Awesome OOB thinking. I cant vote on Adv Ed but 8-9 somewhere.</td>', 'Very clever... not sure how the PP SC council take this but I''m on your side.Awesome OOB thinking. I cant vote on Adv Ed but 8-9 somewhere.', '2009-11-15 12:07:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(5727391, 831599, 108580, '<td valign="top">This is a VitaminB!<br/>Well who knows there are so many Toronto night shots from so many Canadian photogs. Crisp clear exposure, slow shutter to capture some motion and reflection. Beaut shot! Can''t vote but 8-9.</td>', 'This is a VitaminB!Well who knows there are so many Toronto night shots from so many Canadian photogs. Crisp clear exposure, slow shutter to capture some motion and reflection. Beaut shot! Can''t vote but 8-9.', '2009-11-15 12:10:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(5727643, 832563, 43774, '<td valign="top">This is gorgeous.....I bet if it were in the foliage challenge it would come in 1st place.....lets hope it finishes well here too. My #1 pick.</td>', 'This is gorgeous.....I bet if it were in the foliage challenge it would come in 1st place.....lets hope it finishes well here too. My #1 pick.', '2009-11-15 14:09:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(5727722, 832381, 96793, '<td valign="top">i absolutely love this shot. i wouldve preferred if it were straightened but its still an instant winner with me. great perspective of life.</td>', 'i absolutely love this shot. i wouldve preferred if it were straightened but its still an instant winner with me. great perspective of life.', '2009-11-15 14:46:14.000000', NULL, 1),
