(5728808, 831841, 86447, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by AbeSapien2:</b></div><hr/><i> The death of one single red Autumn leaf casually held by a small pond is a memorable study of diverse textures &amp; myriad colours. The subtle rainbows of the rocks blend well with the darker eddies of the quiescent water furnishing last life to the leaf slowly crumbling into pieces. This is beautiful. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>What Abe so aptly said.<br/> <br/>Beautiful, indeed!</td>', 'Originally posted by AbeSapien2: The death of one single red Autumn leaf casually held by a small pond is a memorable study of diverse textures & myriad colours. The subtle rainbows of the rocks blend well with the darker eddies of the quiescent water furnishing last life to the leaf slowly crumbling into pieces. This is beautiful.   What Abe so aptly said. Beautiful, indeed!', '2009-11-16 10:53:25.000000', NULL, 0),
(5728811, 832279, 63503, '<td valign="top">Great shot piba, congratulations !!</td>', 'Great shot piba, congratulations !!', '2009-11-16 10:55:19.000000', NULL, 0),
