(5728843, 831671, 24454, '<td valign="top">This was one of my top picks.  I''m so glad it won an honrable mention -- even tho I would have loved to see it with a ribbon.</td>', 'This was one of my top picks.  I''m so glad it won an honrable mention -- even tho I would have loved to see it with a ribbon.', '2009-11-16 11:12:16.000000', NULL, 0),
