(5728850, 832098, 24454, '<td valign="top">Ooooh, I''m so glad to find out that this is your son. It makes the photo even more meaningful to you and your family forever.  It is SOOOO COOL!  I LOVE IT!!<br/> <br/></td>', 'Ooooh, I''m so glad to find out that this is your son. It makes the photo even more meaningful to you and your family forever.  It is SOOOO COOL!  I LOVE IT!! ', '2009-11-16 11:14:34.000000', NULL, 0),
