(5728860, 832383, 45524, '<td valign="top">So this is nowhere near where I live but if you didn''t know that until you read this then it doesn''t really matter does it? ;) <br/> <br/>I guess it doesn''t if you don''t have a conscience, and I would have to say in the spirit of this challenge that you don''t. Shame too because its a beautiful photo, but will always have an * next to it in many peoples book.</td>', 'So this is nowhere near where I live but if you didn''t know that until you read this then it doesn''t really matter does it? ;)  I guess it doesn''t if you don''t have a conscience, and I would have to say in the spirit of this challenge that you don''t. Shame too because its a beautiful photo, but will always have an * next to it in many peoples book.', '2009-11-16 11:18:43.000000', NULL, 0),
