(5728951, 832148, 81782, '<td valign="top">Well.. congratulations on a wonderful photo. I guess, people were more concerned about 47 steps than the photo. :) As I said, in my comment during voting, its a wonderful shot. Well done.</td>', 'Well.. congratulations on a wonderful photo. I guess, people were more concerned about 47 steps than the photo. :) As I said, in my comment during voting, its a wonderful shot. Well done.', '2009-11-16 12:08:40.000000', NULL, 0),
