(5728977, 832383, 74234, '<td valign="top">you should have come in last... i knew some people would lie about it... after all theres really no way to regulate it. i wish the mods would DQ you... you dont deserve 5th place</td>', 'you should have come in last... i knew some people would lie about it... after all theres really no way to regulate it. i wish the mods would DQ you... you dont deserve 5th place', '2009-11-16 12:26:24.000000', NULL, 0),
