(5728990, 832563, 30982, '<td valign="top">Maybe just a little too perfect - I''m hoping you at least picked up the leaves 47 steps from where you live.  At any rate, it is lovely photography - perfect lighting, composition, and depth of field.  Even your water drops are clean and perfect!</td>', 'Maybe just a little too perfect - I''m hoping you at least picked up the leaves 47 steps from where you live.  At any rate, it is lovely photography - perfect lighting, composition, and depth of field.  Even your water drops are clean and perfect!', '2009-11-16 12:30:12.000000', NULL, 0),
(5729009, 832383, 53964, '<td valign="top">Very tacky. I hope you enjoy your undeserved 5th, and are proud of yourself for pushing down those who actually made an honest effort to meet the challenge.</td>', 'Very tacky. I hope you enjoy your undeserved 5th, and are proud of yourself for pushing down those who actually made an honest effort to meet the challenge.', '2009-11-16 12:37:28.000000', NULL, 0),
