(5729216, 832475, 30982, '<td valign="top">Heh!  You made it considerably above a 5!  And ''twas a good idea.  I did try for this challenge, ended up with a view of the garages across from my door, but never did think to look down.  Smart!</td>', 'Heh!  You made it considerably above a 5!  And ''twas a good idea.  I did try for this challenge, ended up with a view of the garages across from my door, but never did think to look down.  Smart!', '2009-11-16 14:36:51.000000', NULL, 0),
