(5729233, 832383, 52992, '<td valign="top">Sad - even my youngest kids know that cheating to win is not okay at all.<br/> <br/>And I''m guessing you''re older than two  years old, therefore really SHOULD know better.</td>', 'Sad - even my youngest kids know that cheating to win is not okay at all. And I''m guessing you''re older than two  years old, therefore really SHOULD know better.', '2009-11-16 14:43:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(5729235, 832383, 24666, '<td valign="top">I think people on DPC are far too kind , you should be DQ''d , end of story, what I do not understand is that someone with obvious talent is so shallow as to cheat in the hope of a ribbon.I would like to post a small challenge directly to you in the hope that you can redeem yourself , post a picture using the rules as stated for this challenge and prove what a good photographer you are, I have looked at your portfolio and am pretty sure you can come up with something. Good Luck</td>', 'I think people on DPC are far too kind , you should be DQ''d , end of story, what I do not understand is that someone with obvious talent is so shallow as to cheat in the hope of a ribbon.I would like to post a small challenge directly to you in the hope that you can redeem yourself , post a picture using the rules as stated for this challenge and prove what a good photographer you are, I have looked at your portfolio and am pretty sure you can come up with something. Good Luck', '2009-11-16 14:44:08.000000', NULL, 0),
