(5729565, 832562, 96574, '<td valign="top">To Dirt Diver:<br/> <br/>I live in a condominium, and 47 steps from my apartment is an elevator.   I''m sorry that you question my adherence to the challenge, but that''s the truth.  I wish I lived in a house, but unfortunately, I don''t and have to rely on the elevator.  Perhaps, in the future, you should give people the benefit of the doubt.   I am clearly not nuzzer.</td>', 'To Dirt Diver: I live in a condominium, and 47 steps from my apartment is an elevator.   I''m sorry that you question my adherence to the challenge, but that''s the truth.  I wish I lived in a house, but unfortunately, I don''t and have to rely on the elevator.  Perhaps, in the future, you should give people the benefit of the doubt.   I am clearly not nuzzer.', '2009-11-16 18:12:10.000000', NULL, 0),
(5729578, 832475, 110909, '<td valign="top">thanks!  i really like this shot and it was absolutely born out of frustration.  i made probably 20 "47-steps" trips trying to find an interesting shot and nothing came together.  i was worried that people would question whether it was really 47 steps from my door (it was) but it didn''t come up.</td>', 'thanks!  i really like this shot and it was absolutely born out of frustration.  i made probably 20 "47-steps" trips trying to find an interesting shot and nothing came together.  i was worried that people would question whether it was really 47 steps from my door (it was) but it didn''t come up.', '2009-11-16 18:23:15.000000', NULL, 0),
