(5731973, 832069, 106806, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by cogerox:</b></div><hr/><i> I knew this was going to do well. I thought you''d probably ribbon with it. Great shot with <i>really </i>great lighting, and the shallow dof makes it so dramatic and dreamlike at the same time. I have to agree... one of your best. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Yep definitely deserves better the 6th place, fantastic lighting and shallow depth of field getting the eyes just in focus, you must have had to work pretty darn quick as these guys battled it out.</td>', 'Originally posted by cogerox: I knew this was going to do well. I thought you''d probably ribbon with it. Great shot with really great lighting, and the shallow dof makes it so dramatic and dreamlike at the same time. I have to agree... one of your best.   Yep definitely deserves better the 6th place, fantastic lighting and shallow depth of field getting the eyes just in focus, you must have had to work pretty darn quick as these guys battled it out.', '2009-11-18 08:52:23.000000', NULL, 0),
