(5733145, 832383, 73747, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by steve100:</b></div><hr/><i> I think people on DPC are far too kind , you should be DQ''d , end of story, what I do not understand is that someone with obvious talent is so shallow as to cheat in the hope of a ribbon.I would like to post a small challenge directly to you in the hope that you can redeem yourself , post a picture using the rules as stated for this challenge and prove what a good photographer you are, I have looked at your portfolio and am pretty sure you can come up with something. Good Luck </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>I agree. Pretty disgusting.  Wish I could withdraw my vote. Good to see people are upset about this cheap behavior, though.</td>', 'Originally posted by steve100: I think people on DPC are far too kind , you should be DQ''d , end of story, what I do not understand is that someone with obvious talent is so shallow as to cheat in the hope of a ribbon.I would like to post a small challenge directly to you in the hope that you can redeem yourself , post a picture using the rules as stated for this challenge and prove what a good photographer you are, I have looked at your portfolio and am pretty sure you can come up with something. Good Luck   I agree. Pretty disgusting.  Wish I could withdraw my vote. Good to see people are upset about this cheap behavior, though.', '2009-11-18 23:27:51.000000', NULL, 0),
