(5859841, 832383, 101117, '<td valign="top">I just came across this again and was just reading back through the comments in amazement at the vast amount of outage.<br/> <br/>Love the fact you marked them all as helpful though!<br/> <br/>Nice shot, didn''t belong in the challenge, but hey, what can you do, I would imagine there were many more other than yours in the exact same situation, only difference is that you pointed it out!</td>', 'I just came across this again and was just reading back through the comments in amazement at the vast amount of outage. Love the fact you marked them all as helpful though! Nice shot, didn''t belong in the challenge, but hey, what can you do, I would imagine there were many more other than yours in the exact same situation, only difference is that you pointed it out!', '2010-02-08 21:22:09.000000', NULL, 0),
